# demo-mod: slot 0 is the patched starter (Dripling, renamed Rainlet), and the guide's idle label is
# overridden with a new line (the text itself is checked in packages/cli/src/replays.test.ts).
# Timings (real World/VM, 30 Hz): map loads fade 8 ticks; walk 8 ticks per tile; a new direction first
# turns (2 ticks); text prints 1 char per 2 ticks; the guide's "!" lasts 30 ticks.
#
# new game: spawn in the room; the onFrame intro starts once the fade-in ends
0 assert map fixture:ROOM
0 assert position fixture:ROOM 14 16
12 assert message open
80 press a
82 release a
86 assert message closed
# to the exit mat, then push down into the door warp
90 press right
94 release right
110 assert position fixture:ROOM 15 16
110 press down
130 release down
150 assert position fixture:ROOM 15 19
150 press down
152 release down
170 assert map fixture:TOWN
# the town door (10,13) opens under the fade in; the player walks out of it, south, and it closes (until 180)
170 assert position fixture:TOWN 10 14
# down to the path row, then east along it into the coord trigger (x 38)
170 press down
190 release down
200 assert position fixture:TOWN 10 16
200 press right
422 release right
426 assert position fixture:TOWN 38 16
# the scene: the guide walks up from 44,16; two message pages
430 assert message closed
590 assert message open
600 press a
602 release a
606 assert message open
730 press a
732 release a
# the starter panel: slot 0 is Dripling in this mod; pick it and answer Yes
740 assert message closed
740 press a
742 release a
800 assert message open
810 press a
812 release a
816 assert party 0 fixture:SPECIES_DRIPLING
816 assert var fixture:VAR_PLAYER_STARTER 3
890 press a
892 release a
940 assert message closed
940 assert var fixture:VAR_SCENE 1
# the guide is back at 44,16; walk up to it (the last push bumps) and talk: the overridden label runs
940 press right
990 release right
1000 assert position fixture:TOWN 43 16
1010 press a
1012 release a
1016 assert message open
1140 press a
1142 release a
1150 assert message closed
1150 assert party 0 fixture:SPECIES_DRIPLING
